model HeatingPipe
  "Model of a heating distribution netwrok. Pipe model using a 1-D fluid flow model (finite volume discretization - incompressible fluid model)."
  /******************** Parameters ********************/
  parameter Integer N_p(min=1)=1 "number of cells in parallel";
